{"version":1,"id":"big-sean-jump-out-the-window","title":"Jump Out The Window","artist":"Big Sean","key":"Bbm","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/big-sean/jump-out-the-window/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Poo Bear, Darhyl Camper Jr, Big Sean and Dwane Marshall Weir Ii","chords":[{"symbol":"A#m","canonical":"A#m","keyboardPitchClasses":[10,1,5],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"D#m","canonical":"D#m","keyboardPitchClasses":[3,6,10],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Fm","canonical":"Fm","keyboardPitchClasses":[5,8,0],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"lyric","text":"I think I'm ready to jump out the window","columns":41,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#m","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":14,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Fm","column":23,"beat":4},{"symbol":"D#m","column":38,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"And turn that nigga that you with right back into your friend, though","columns":69,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#m","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":15,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Fm","column":31,"beat":4},{"symbol":"D#m","column":57,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"We already wasted too much time","columns":31,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#m","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":28,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"And your time is the only thing I wish was mine","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":10,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":27,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"So yeah, oh yeah, I think I'm ready to jump out the window","columns":67,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#m","column":31,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":41,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Fm","column":54,"beat":4},{"symbol":"D#m","column":64,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"section","text":"[Verse 1]","columns":9,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"Straight up, straight up, look","columns":30,"beats":4,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"Know ya momma didn’t raise you to take no disrespect, yeah","columns":58,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#m","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":14,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Fm","column":23,"beat":4},{"symbol":"D#m","column":43,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"I feel, I feel like real queens know how to keep the game in check, yeah","columns":72,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#m","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":28,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Fm","column":46,"beat":4},{"symbol":"D#m","column":61,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"You cried on my phone the whole night","columns":37,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#m","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":26,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"That time he crossed the line yeah, yeah, yeah","columns":46,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":27,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"(Oh I was there) I went to straighten his ass out","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#m","column":21,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":31,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"And you told me never mind yeah, yeah, yeah","columns":43,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":9,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":24,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"The question isn't, \"Do he love ya?\" The question is, \"Do ya love yourself?\"","columns":76,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#m","column":14,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":50,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"You give the best advice to your friends and not take it for yourself","columns":69,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":14,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":49,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"Remember when you used to come through and hit the Mario Kart","columns":61,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#m","column":27,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":53,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"And you always picked the princess","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":11,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":36,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"I realized you was princess way back then","columns":50,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#m","column":21,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":47,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"We the best thing that never happened, but","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":33,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"section","text":"[Hook]","columns":6,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"I think I'm ready to jump out the window","columns":41,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#m","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":14,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Fm","column":23,"beat":4},{"symbol":"D#m","column":38,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"And turn that nigga that you with right back into your friend, though","columns":69,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#m","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":15,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Fm","column":31,"beat":4},{"symbol":"D#m","column":57,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"We already wasted too much time","columns":31,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#m","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":28,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"And your time is the only thing I wish was mine","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":10,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":27,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"So yeah, oh yeah, I think I'm ready to jump out the window","columns":67,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#m","column":31,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":41,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Fm","column":54,"beat":4},{"symbol":"D#m","column":64,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"section","text":"[Verse 2]","columns":9,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"You been up at night, sleep deprivation","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#m","column":9,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"What's the hesitation? What's ya reservation?","columns":45,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#m","column":12,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-29","kind":"lyric","text":"You been trippin', trippin' with no destination","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":13,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-30","kind":"lyric","text":"You need separation, you need recreation","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#m","column":10,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-31","kind":"lyric","text":"Y'all been arguing every other day","columns":34,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#m","column":13,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-32","kind":"lyric","text":"Ya friends gotta step in and break it up like chill, chill, chill","columns":65,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#m","column":18,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Fm","column":60,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-33","kind":"lyric","text":"It's no need to turn this into Kill Bill, look","columns":46,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#m","column":17,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-34","kind":"lyric","text":"Funny we ran into each other while we leaving","columns":45,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#m","column":9,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-35","kind":"lyric","text":"You walked in with a perm","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#m","column":7,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-36","kind":"lyric","text":"And now yo' hair look like The Weeknd's","columns":39,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Fm","column":13,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#m","column":33,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-37","kind":"lyric","text":"I know that you been needin' clarity","columns":36,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#m","column":11,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-38","kind":"lyric","text":"Don't mean to sit ya down and turn